Release number 13 / Serial number 880501

You drove west from London all day in your new little British sports car. Now at last you've arrived in the storied land of Cornwall.

Dusk has fallen as you pull up in front of Tresyllian Castle. A ghostly full moon is rising, and a tall iron gate between two pillars bars the way into the courtyard.

What would you like to do?
>
[I don't know the word "#random."]

What would you like to do?
>
[I beg your pardon?]

What would you like to do?
>
(You are now in the driveway.)
(You're sitting in the sports car.)
You are by the front gate of Tresyllian Castle. You can hear the ocean beating urgently against the rocks far below.
In the moonlit gloom, you can make out an ornament on the gate. It's a winged, two-legged dragon called a wyvern, which crests the Tresyllian family's coat of arms.
The dragon appears in profile. The moonlight glints on its lone visible eye.

What next?
>
(The castle is south of here.)

What next?
>
(You can't drink the sports car.)

[You won't see "What next?" any more.]

>
You talk to the sports car for a minute before you realize that it won't respond.

>
(You aren't holding yourself!)

>
You're wearing the tweed outfit!

>
Wheeeeeeeeee!!!!!

>
(You can't open the tweed outfit.)

>
Too bad, but the front gate is closed.

>
Before you unfasten even the first button, you decide that this isn't a good place to undress.

>
(You can't get in yourself.)

>
Too bad, but the front gate is closed.

>
Too bad, but the front gate is closed.

>
(The castle is south of here.)

>
Too bad, but the front gate is closed.

>
[Sorry, but I don't understand. Please say that another way, or try something else.]

>
You look over the horn for a minute and find nothing suspicious -- for now.

>
Too bad, but the front gate is closed.
The dragon's eye glows red. A voice comes from a hidden speaker. It says:
"Please announce yourself. State your title -- such as Lord or Lady, Sir or Dame, Mr. or Ms. -- and your first and last name."
>
"Did you say your name is Listen To Car?"
